IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ppsa-surcharge`

-- Parking Places (Surcharge) Act 1975, ss 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_parking-places-surcharge-act-1975.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a shopping mall car park in a designated area` MEANS `Car park` WITH
    `motor vehicles it is used to park` IS 400
    `in a designated area` IS TRUE
    `exempted by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `a private parking place used exclusively with a private dwelling house` IS FALSE
    `vehicles kept for private use only` IS FALSE

`an office car park outside any designated area` MEANS `Car park` WITH
    `motor vehicles it is used to park` IS 80
    `in a designated area` IS FALSE
    `exempted by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `a private parking place used exclusively with a private dwelling house` IS FALSE
    `vehicles kept for private use only` IS FALSE

`a shophouse yard for four cars in a designated area` MEANS `Car park` WITH
    `motor vehicles it is used to park` IS 4
    `in a designated area` IS TRUE
    `exempted by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `a private parking place used exclusively with a private dwelling house` IS FALSE
    `vehicles kept for private use only` IS FALSE

`a yard for exactly five cars in a designated area` MEANS `Car park` WITH
    `motor vehicles it is used to park` IS 5
    `in a designated area` IS TRUE
    `exempted by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `a private parking place used exclusively with a private dwelling house` IS FALSE
    `vehicles kept for private use only` IS FALSE

`an exempted hotel car park in a designated area` MEANS `Car park` WITH
    `motor vehicles it is used to park` IS 150
    `in a designated area` IS TRUE
    `exempted by the Minister` IS TRUE
    `a private parking place used exclusively with a private dwelling house` IS FALSE
    `vehicles kept for private use only` IS FALSE

`a large private house drive for six family cars in a designated area` MEANS `Car park` WITH
    `motor vehicles it is used to park` IS 6
    `in a designated area` IS TRUE
    `exempted by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `a private parking place used exclusively with a private dwelling house` IS TRUE
    `vehicles kept for private use only` IS TRUE

`a private house drive also used by a business's vans` MEANS `Car park` WITH
    `motor vehicles it is used to park` IS 6
    `in a designated area` IS TRUE
    `exempted by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `a private parking place used exclusively with a private dwelling house` IS TRUE
    `vehicles kept for private use only` IS FALSE

`a car park for private cars shared by a house and a shop` MEANS `Car park` WITH
    `motor vehicles it is used to park` IS 6
    `in a designated area` IS TRUE
    `exempted by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `a private parking place used exclusively with a private dwelling house` IS FALSE
    `vehicles kept for private use only` IS TRUE

